{
    "title": "Bleacher Report: Sports News",
    "description": "Stay up to date with the latest sports news, shows, live scores, stats, & epic highlights of your favorite sports & teams. Get sports alerts instantly, as stories break across the NBA, College Basketball, NFL, MLB, NCAA College Football, WNBA, NHL, MLS soccer & all-world football teams. Stay up to date on your favorite college sports news & events such as NCAA college football, college basketball, college baseball & more!\r\n\r\nThe sports news cycle never ends! Get instant sports news alerts & flash notifications on the latest rumors, trades, predictions & breaking stories for the NBA, NFL, MLB, NHL, WNBA, MLS & more!\r\n\r\nBe a fantasy champion with instant sports news alerts & injury updates for your Fantasy Football team or the latest stats or sports scores for your fantasy basketball team to stay ahead of your competition!\r\n\r\nPick your favorite teams, & instantly get the latest sports news alerts, scores, & more personalized stats through a singular sports app designed for you!\r\n\r\nNBA Highlights, Alerts, Stats, Scores & News\r\n\u2022 Exclusive NBA basketball stats, League articles, rankings & predictions\r\n\u2022 Never miss a game of your favorite team with live NBA plays and scores\r\n\u2022 Get the NBA highlights & NBA scores you need to become a fantasy basketball champion\r\n\u2022 Follow your favorite NBA players throughout the season and catch the hottest trade predictions\r\n\u2022 Keep up to date on all the action with instant NBA Alerts\r\n\r\nNFL Alerts, Scores & Updates\r\n\u2022 Instant NFL Updates: Stay up to date on the latest trades, cuts & signings from the NFL season\r\n\u2022 Follow your team\u2019s every move with the latest NFL news and NFL highlights\r\n\u2022 Get all the NFL stats, news, scores & NFL highlights, everything your fantasy football team needs to dominate\r\n\u2022 Catch Cleats & Convos with Deebo Samuel presented by State Farm every Tuesday throughout the NFL season to get and inside look into the NFL \r\n\u2022 Watch The Edge with Micah Parsons live to get the hottest takes from around every corner of the league\r\n\r\nNCAA College Sports\r\n\u2022 College basketball scores and stats for every team all season long\r\n\u2022 NCAA college football game highlights as they happen with live alerts!\r\n\u2022 From college to pro, all in one sports app!\r\n\r\nMLB Scores, Alerts & MLB Highlights\r\n\u2022 Never miss a game of your favorite team with live MLB scores\r\n\u2022 Keep track of all the latest updates with instant MLB Alerts during the off-season\r\n\u2022 Get your fantasy baseball team ready with all the MLB baseball stats, ranking & predictions you need!\r\n\r\nCollege Football\r\n\u2022 Keep up with the college football season with NCAA football experts\r\n\u2022 Never miss a moment in college football with instant news & NCAA football alerts\r\n\u2022 Stay up to date on the latest college football transfers, hires, & more!\r\n\r\nWNBA\r\n\u2022 Follow Catlin Clark, Angel Reese & all the WNBA rookies progress in the off-season\r\n\u2022 Stay up to date with the WNBA with the latest sports news \r\n\u2022 Follow games with WNBA live scores & updates\r\n\u2022 Never miss a WNBA moment with instant sports alerts\r\n\r\nNHL\r\n\u2022 Follow your team throughout the season and the push to the playoffs with instant NHL news, stats, NHL highlights & sports alerts\r\n\u2022 Keep up with the latest storylines, expert analysis & more!\r\n\u2022 Stay tuned with NHL highlights & NHL scores from your favorite NHL hockey teams\r\n\r\nSoccer\r\n\u2022 Get the latest soccer news, scores & sports alerts for your favorite teams & players\r\n\u2022 Live scores & epic highlights for MLS, Premier League, Champions League, La Liga & Bundesliga matches!\r\n\r\nFan easier, fan better & fan faster with Bleacher Report with instant sports news alerts & exclusive coverage on all your favorite NBA, NFL, MLB, WNBA, NHL, XFL, MLS & all-world football teams!",
